Z||000016||California Kid||11-23-2001||07:13 PM||||  <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by GTFiero1:<BR><B> um...dont those Vette symbols on your car mimick the vette to much? that and the v-8    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><BR>The Vette symbols on my car are a true indication of the engine in it, which originally came out of a '91 Corvette. I only added them to get a little more attention from people at shows, where typically I'm up against muscle cars, it worked by the way!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">  There isn't anything on the exterior that suggests vette.<P>I'm not saying the Vette isn't a good target to shot at for styling cues, but I think the Fiero can look better than it.<P>The only reason for my comment is that the Fiero already has great lines, any changes must be thought out very well to improve on the appearance. But, everyone's taste is a little different, just suggesting explore a lot of options before jumping into something, the result is usually better!!!<P><p>[This message has been edited by California Kid (edited 11-23-2001).]||||reg||1
